        "id": 181506,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-24T01:35:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When the Preview Pack is ready and I'm sure Handelabra will make it well known they are releasing it. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, they don't exactly use stealth releases for new content. &nbsp;Between the app splash screen, the mailing list, and Twitter, it'll be kind of hard to miss its release. &nbsp;Just follow one of their social media accounts or sign up for the mailing list and you'll be good.</p>",
