        "raw": "[quote=\"Powerhound_2000\"]\n\nWhen the Preview Pack is ready and I&#39;m sure Handelabra will make it well known they are releasing it. &nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nYeah, they don&#39;t exactly use stealth releases for new content. &nbsp;Between the app splash screen, the mailing list, and Twitter, it&#39;ll be kind of hard to miss its release. &nbsp;Just follow one of their social media accounts or sign up for the mailing list and you&#39;ll be good.\n",
